-## Quick Start Checklist
-
-### Prerequisites
-- [ ] Azure subscription created
-- [ ] Azure CLI installed and authenticated (`az login`)
-- [ ] Resource group created for AI Gateway resources
-
-### Deployment
-- [ ] Deploy APIM with Basicv2 SKU
-- [ ] Configure managed identity
